The family uses the integral definition from the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.07981); it avoids the polynomial-time fractional relaxation. General partial-STS completion is NP-complete per [Colbourn (1983)](https://doi.org/10.1016/0097-3165(83)90031-6).

`submit.sh` was not run because it commits and pushes repository state; this environment also lacks a `.git` directory. All equivalent local interface, syntax, JSON, determinism, transcript-schema, and report-reproduction checks passed.
